Package: axclhost-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: axclhost-firmware, task-axclhost, ${misc:Depends}, gcc (>= 9.4.0), make, patch, kmod
Description: AXCL Host driver DKMS package
 This package contains the DKMS source for the AXCL host driver.
 It will automatically build and install the kernel modules for your
 current kernel when the package is installed.
 .
 This package includes the following modules:
  - ax_pcie_host_dev: Base PCIe device driver
  - ax_pcie_msg: Message transport module
  - ax_pcie_mmb: Memory management module
  - axcl_host: Main host driver
  - ax_pcie_p2p_rc: Point-to-point communication module

Package: axclhost-firmware
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: AXCL Host firmware and tools
 This package contains firmware files and user-space tools for AXCL host.

Package: task-axclhost
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: AXCL Host configuration package
 This package contains configuration files for AXCL host.
